  "headline": "Michael Sianipar Questioned By PSSI Ethics Committee Over FFI Case",
  "seoTitle": "Michael Sianipar Questioned By PSSI Ethics Committee",
  "metaDescription": "Michael Sianipar underwent a two-hour examination by the PSSI Ethics Committee regarding his removal as FFI Chairman and allegations of procedural flaws.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Michael Sianipar was examined for two hours by the PSSI Ethics Committee regarding his dismissal as chairman of the Federasi Futsal Indonesia.",
    "Sianipar filed a formal complaint naming Erick Thohir and Yunus Nusi, citing alleged procedural irregularities and external intervention.",
    "The former chairman has declined to participate in the upcoming extraordinary congress, which he characterizes as an illegal proceeding."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The dispute centers on the removal of Michael Sianipar from his position as chairman of the Federasi Futsal Indonesia (FFI). Sianipar has formally challenged the decision by filing an ethics report with the PSSI Ethics Committee. His complaint includes four primary points, ranging from the lack of a proper right of reply to claims of unauthorized intervention by PSSI leadership. While PSSI officials maintain that the FFI operates under its umbrella, Sianipar argues that the extraordinary congress scheduled for December 11 is illegitimate. He has publicly stated he will not participate in the election process for the congress. The PSSI Ethics Committee has now conducted an initial examination to address the grievances. This investigation follows a period of mounting tension regarding organizational governance and decision-making authority within the national futsal federation.",
